        "original_id": "9662a3c2-0138-562c-8714-01a2e46cbb55",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Cartoon Network Too, Nick Jr. Too, Teletoon\n- Products: Skatoony\n- Topics: channel launches, overnight reruns\n\nFacts:\n- Nick Jr. Too launched on 24 April 2006, the same day that rival channel Cartoon Network Too launched.\n- Cartoon Network Too aired some no-longer-produced and lower-demand shows during overnight hours, usually between midnight and 06:00.\n- Skatoony was an example of a show aired by Cartoon Network Too during those overnight hours.\n- Reruns of Skatoony are still occasionally shown on Teletoon in Canada.",
